{"4124350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Excavator Simulator REMAKE", "steam_appid": 4124350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Excavator Simulator Remake</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic physics, detailed excavator controls, and authentic job-site missions, Excavator Simulator Remake puts you right in the heart of heavy-duty construction. Enhanced visuals, optimized camera transitions, and richly designed scenes offer a simulation experience that’s both technically satisfying and genuinely fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 12 unique and realistic scenarios<br>• VR support for the most realistic excavator operating experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ISO - SAE Control Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play freely or practice with dedicated excavator training mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Full simulation support with keyboard, gamepad, and Dual joystick support<u><strong> (currently limited to Logitech Extreme 3D)</strong></u> compatibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Demolish buildings, dig trenches, load coal, clear mines — a variety of exciting tasks to sharpen your excavator skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• English and Turkish language support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Immersive sound design with realistic hydraulic, engine, and track effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for small talk — grab the controls and <strong>SMASH, BREAK, DEMOLISH!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NOTE: The game supports VR (Virtual Reality) headsets, and it can run on both a regular monitor and VR headsets simultaneously. From the Game Settings, you can enable the VR Support option to play the game in VR mode as well.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Excavator Simulator Remake</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic physics, detailed excavator controls, and authentic job-site missions, Excavator Simulator Remake puts you right in the heart of heavy-duty construction. Enhanced visuals, optimized camera transitions, and richly designed scenes offer a simulation experience that’s both technically satisfying and genuinely fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 12 unique and realistic scenarios<br>• VR support for the most realistic excavator operating experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ISO - SAE Control Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play freely or practice with dedicated excavator training mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Full simulation support with keyboard, gamepad, and Dual joystick support<u><strong> (currently limited to Logitech Extreme 3D)</strong></u> compatibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Demolish buildings, dig trenches, load coal, clear mines — a variety of exciting tasks to sharpen your excavator skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• English and Turkish language support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Immersive sound design with realistic hydraulic, engine, and track effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for small talk — grab the controls and <strong>SMASH, BREAK, DEMOLISH!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NOTE: The game supports VR (Virtual Reality) headsets, and it can run on both a regular monitor and VR headsets simultaneously. From the Game Settings, you can enable the VR Support option to play the game in VR mode as well.</i></p>", "short_description": "Realistic Excavator Simulation is now on the PC platform. Dig canals, demolish buildings, load rocks, clear landmines. Control the Giant Machine with different, exciting and educational levels.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124350/fa6c1cded1e9821482ec9219f